# Behold the Sinister Six! {6}{B}: "Return up to six target creature cards with different names from your graveyard to the battlefield"
# (CR 115.1, 201.2b). Wheel of Fortune puts two Ornithopters, Glistener Elf, Benalish Hero and Mesa Pegasus in Bot1's graveyard. Both
# Ornithopters at once are refused (the same name twice), as is Bot2's Healer's Hawk (not "from your graveyard"); Ornithopter, Glistener Elf, Benalish
# Hero and Mesa Pegasus are four different names and return together, leaving the second Ornithopter behind.
# Six moxes and a Swamp pay the seven mana.

